e_20260315_181853_1.png", "id": "1390855772752105", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821150_1390855776085438_518964886247908172_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VJZ-ZWFER1gQ7kNvwFs8EjU&_nc_oc=Adod-cCq5tp49ykZiXE2S0hOErHLuyz7ZbmvMcmU1FR5_BPNkJjevchaIDXjIZe2AGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9NQb4W2b9PTVpG5Xq5-RjS7i0ut2RS6r8JQMVPF4LHBA&oe=6A2AD026"}, {"file_name": "Capture_20260315_155317.png", "id": "1245249911030697", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618515_1245249917697363_6858689425687578518_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9xgmXKzy4ZAQ7kNvwH3_Z1C&_nc_oc=AdowIuZNdnP_wsHUXnTkzhvlLCJhWNAUxmRm6J5zdF_DuzdJ31zYFewqWu4O9l4UEW4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9pOQpeXk7MaFkAlNCO_APcs91_yCygglqF2sq7x3uR0Q&oe=6A2AAE4D"}, {"file_name": "Capture_20260315_155550.png", "id": "2084145212382932", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_2084145215716265_2997334577020385787_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hf9G2xh3QN0Q7kNvwHv-OQV&_nc_oc=AdqsBotT_eP5zFv6kdmDtwxTYKR2WyQsKlYSFd9bpZJLLiPi0OQdqE16wRJUBQudEtI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-s2TAtIW86SxK0kr77Sg02n49TbjN-Q9wisjiUtU53_A&oe=6A2ABF05"}, {"file_name": "Capture_20260315_182338.png", "id": "1426078055863789", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296119_1426078059197122_3984945434794372216_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7H2aiqgcY_UQ7kNvwF02onM&_nc_oc=AdpQdy7nsU761H5ova6N8YbCVPaMZJTEhK5yw9plrIZMXG-GSyoq6RFe7UoJxyIvWXk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_VNnvFNI3ce8c_6TMxn4oMnx3zU_dLTdvvA1wgkTTfdQ&oe=6A2AB67E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Escape:The Nought", "keywords": ["EscapeRoom", "Puzzle"], "long_description": "\u25b6 Multiple Themed Mystery Spaces\nA single, grand journey awaits you with rooms of distinct charm. Explore everything from a classic room filled with antique furniture to a laboratory researching mysterious plants and viruses.\n{1295233762508130}\n\n\u25b6 Intriguing and Diverse Puzzle Gimmicks\nExperience multi-dimensional puzzles that go beyond simple locks, requiring you to physically touch, manipulate, and deduce.\n{1234634868879854}\n\n    Unknown Virus Lab: Crack computer passwords and manipulate suspicious incubators to uncover the secrets hidden within the laboratory.\n\n    Hidden Truths Revealed by Light: Discover hidden messages that are invisible to the naked eye.\n\n    Props Hiding Secret Meanings: Place the knight statue's sword in its rightful position, and find the hidden rules among seemingly ordinary objects like a dartboard and Matryoshka dolls to open locked doors.\n{1234834418631090}\n\nUse all your senses and deductive skills to solve the puzzles and open the closed doors.\nWill you be able to safely escape at the end of this mysterious space?", "short_description": "Trapped in diverse themed rooms connected through a massive central hub, you must use your interactive skills and deductive reasoning to uncover hidden truths. A variety of puzzles await you. Piece together the clues and escape this bizarre space!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://seereal-escape.notion.site/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SeeReal", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://seereal-escape.notion.site/escape-the-nought", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "r